WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.055 --> 00:01.515
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.515 --> 00:02.755
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.755 --> 00:03.825
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:26.144 --> 00:28.004
I think this is our first formal introduction.

6
00:29.774 --> 00:30.774
Yes.

7
00:41.424 --> 00:42.554
Hello, Han Gyu Oh.

8
00:43.954 --> 00:46.224
I am Kim Mu Jin, your new older brother as of today.

9
00:56.734 --> 00:58.804
South Korea is a democratic country,

10
00:58.874 --> 01:00.144
and in a democracy,

11
01:00.204 --> 01:02.274
you have the freedom to choose your profession, but...

12
01:05.074 --> 01:06.544
Working at a host bar is a bit much, is it not?

13
01:15.254 --> 01:17.254
(Episode 19)

14
01:20.364 --> 01:21.364
Wipe it.

15
01:23.034 --> 01:24.064
Wipe the blood.

16
01:29.874 --> 01:31.074
Did Han Gyu Seo tell you?

17
01:34.474 --> 01:35.504
Is that important?

18
01:45.154 --> 01:46.184
It is about hiding it from Gyu Rim,

19
01:46.254 --> 01:47.254
is it not?

20
01:50.554 --> 01:53.524
Gyu Rim does not know. And she will not know in the future.

21
01:53.594 --> 01:55.164
I will make sure she never finds out no matter what.

22
01:59.404 --> 02:00.804
If she ever finds out...

23
02:00.864 --> 02:02.534
I will beat you so badly...

24
02:02.604 --> 02:03.934
you will be completely unrecognizable.

25
02:11.014 --> 02:14.114
These are written confessions. One is from Son Ji Yeol,

26
02:14.184 --> 02:17.054
and the other is from your host bar manager.

27
02:17.114 --> 02:18.154
For your information,

28
02:18.214 --> 02:20.584
Son Ji Yeol is almost completely back to normal.

29
02:20.654 --> 02:22.584
He is perfectly fine now, even healthy enough...

30
02:22.654 --> 02:24.294
to travel to Hawaii.

31
02:25.524 --> 02:27.664
Talk about needing another surgery was a complete lie.

32
02:27.724 --> 02:30.194
He, his wife, and your host bar manager conspired...

33
02:30.264 --> 02:33.704
to scam you and extort your money under various excuses.

34
02:33.764 --> 02:35.204
I am tired of explaining it,

35
02:37.774 --> 02:38.974
so read it and see for yourself.

36
02:42.174 --> 02:43.574
(Written Confession: I, Son Ji Yeol...)

37
02:43.644 --> 02:45.444
They were even surprised among themselves...

38
02:45.514 --> 02:47.844
by your stupidity and ignorance.

39
02:47.914 --> 02:49.914
You are 28 years old.

40
02:52.214 --> 02:53.824
How could you not suspect a thing...

41
02:53.884 --> 02:56.624
having your hard-earned money extorted for eight years?

42
02:56.694 --> 02:58.754
How could you not verify it even once?

43
02:58.824 --> 03:00.264
They said they'd never seen...

44
03:00.324 --> 03:02.464
such a gullible fool like you before.

45
03:02.524 --> 03:04.134
Is there something wrong with your brain?

46
03:04.194 --> 03:06.004
Do you want to take a cognitive ability test or something?

47
03:07.034 --> 03:08.104
Hey.

48
03:08.764 --> 03:10.574
You will not be able to find them even if you go right now.

49
03:10.634 --> 03:11.634
They turned themselves in to the police...

50
03:11.704 --> 03:13.104
because they were afraid you would beat them to death.

51
03:15.504 --> 03:17.514
The police will contact you,

52
03:17.574 --> 03:19.644
so handle all future procedures legally.

53
03:20.714 --> 03:21.714
Darn it.

54
03:26.424 --> 03:27.724
Let us go to my place for round two.

55
03:29.124 --> 03:30.694
Goodness.

56
03:30.754 --> 03:31.754
You look beaten half to death already...

57
03:31.824 --> 03:33.724
before I even touched you.

58
03:33.794 --> 03:35.624
How can you go home looking like that?

59
03:35.694 --> 03:36.764
Gyu Rim will faint.

60
03:38.234 --> 03:39.234
Hey.

61
03:40.364 --> 03:41.634
I cannot just let you go today.

62
03:42.634 --> 03:43.674
It is obvious...

63
03:43.734 --> 03:45.834
- you are going to cause trouble. - Darn it.

64
03:51.974 --> 03:54.184
As you felt earlier,

65
03:54.244 --> 03:55.684
my fists are still quite useful.

66
03:58.084 --> 03:59.724
What will it be?

67
03:59.784 --> 04:01.454
Do you want to get beaten up more, or will you just come quietly?

68
04:56.314 --> 04:58.874
Who is that scary thug in your room?

69
05:00.844 --> 05:01.984
Gyu Rim's brother.

70
05:02.044 --> 05:04.384
He is not a thug, and he is not scary at all.

71
05:04.454 --> 05:06.014
He is just...

72
05:06.084 --> 05:08.124
an idiot, an idiot.

73
05:08.184 --> 05:09.454
So?

74
05:09.524 --> 05:11.854
Whether he is a thug, an idiot, or Gyu Rim's brother,

75
05:11.924 --> 05:15.164
why is he glaring like that in your room?

76
05:15.224 --> 05:16.234
Well,

77
05:19.034 --> 05:20.134
there is a reason for that.

78
05:21.264 --> 05:24.204
He will be staying here for a while, so do not go and provoke him.

79
05:25.234 --> 05:27.704
I will book a hotel for you, so will you stay there?

80
05:27.774 --> 05:30.214
Is this Gyu Rim's family vacation home?

81
05:30.274 --> 05:32.174
Is it an exclusive guest house for her family?

82
05:32.244 --> 05:33.844
Why do her son and brother...

83
05:33.914 --> 05:35.644
take turns staying here?

84
05:35.714 --> 05:36.984
Keep your voice down.

85
05:38.914 --> 05:41.654
Here. Go stay at a hotel.

86
05:41.724 --> 05:44.254
Why would I go to a hotel when I have my own house?

87
05:46.694 --> 05:47.894
Darn it...

88
05:49.294 --> 05:50.534
Then you...

89
05:52.334 --> 05:55.564
Tell me just one thing you want the most...

90
05:55.634 --> 05:57.334
out of everything I own.

91
05:57.404 --> 06:00.644
Why? You will give it to me if I keep my mouth shut?

92
06:00.704 --> 06:02.504
Wow, what kind of person...

93
06:02.574 --> 06:04.944
- does this guy think I am? - Is there nothing you want?

94
06:06.884 --> 06:09.184
Do you really think I am that kind of...

95
06:13.024 --> 06:14.984
The basketball shoes Stephen Curry...

96
06:15.054 --> 06:16.084
wore in Game 6 of the 2015 NBA Finals...

97
06:16.154 --> 06:17.154
when he won the championship.

98
06:17.224 --> 06:18.454
The ones you went all the way to New York...

99
06:18.524 --> 06:20.494
to win at auction. How much were they again?

100
06:23.234 --> 06:25.364
- What is the second thing you want? - Nothing.

101
06:47.784 --> 06:49.154
What a cold-hearted girl.

102
06:50.794 --> 06:52.254
She picked the exact time we were out...

103
06:52.324 --> 06:53.964
to pack up all her things and leave.

104
06:56.064 --> 06:57.664
She did not even say goodbye.

105
07:06.944 --> 07:09.374
They say you might not notice when someone moves in,

106
07:09.444 --> 07:11.074
but you definitely notice when they move out.

107
07:12.744 --> 07:13.884
You know,

108
07:15.714 --> 07:16.814
when I think about how Gyu Young...

109
07:16.884 --> 07:18.554
will never come back to this house...

110
07:20.854 --> 07:24.254
It feels like there is a gaping hole right here, Gyu Rim.

111
07:24.324 --> 07:26.264
The freezing wind is blowing right through.

112
07:29.524 --> 07:31.694
She will call you, Father.

113
07:33.464 --> 07:35.264
I will not answer even if she calls.

114
07:35.334 --> 07:37.834
Do you think I have no pride?

115
07:39.644 --> 07:41.604
I will just consider it as never having had her.

116
07:48.984 --> 07:50.654
Do you think she is just completely happy...

117
07:52.154 --> 07:54.724
after leaving like that?

118
07:56.654 --> 07:57.824
- Cheers. - Cheers.

119
08:00.864 --> 08:03.534
Thank you for welcoming me, Father and Mother.

120
08:03.594 --> 08:06.094
I will be the most lovely, proud,

121
08:06.164 --> 08:08.004
and beautiful daughter-in-law in the world.

122
08:08.064 --> 08:11.234
Oh my, I am so happy today.

123
08:13.104 --> 08:14.544
Mom, Dad, are you not...

124
08:14.604 --> 08:16.244
completely smitten with our Gyu Young?

125
08:16.314 --> 08:19.944
I am barely holding back from giving her a piggyback ride.

126
08:20.014 --> 08:21.914
But my dear daughter-in-law,

127
08:21.984 --> 08:24.554
while your new house is being remodelled,

128
08:24.614 --> 08:26.984
you'll have to stay here with us...

129
08:27.054 --> 08:28.984
- Won't that be uncomfortable? - Oh, of course it will be.

130
08:29.054 --> 08:30.654
How could it not be?

131
08:30.724 --> 08:32.794
Not at all. It won't be uncomfortable in the slightest,

132
08:32.854 --> 08:34.464
and I actually love the idea.

133
08:34.524 --> 08:36.694
Oh my, we keep calling her pretty,

134
08:36.764 --> 08:39.704
and she just keeps saying the prettiest things.

135
08:39.764 --> 08:43.134
What could possibly be good about living with your in-laws?

136
08:43.204 --> 08:45.774
Oh, I mean it. I'm being sincere, Mother.

137
08:45.834 --> 08:48.574
Your daughter went abroad to study, so if Sung Wook moved out too,

138
08:48.644 --> 08:50.544
you two would have been so lonely.

139
08:50.614 --> 08:53.114
Until the remodelling is finished, I'll live here with you...

140
08:53.184 --> 08:55.184
and act as your daughter...

141
08:57.784 --> 09:00.224
Please be patient with my shortcomings...

142
09:00.284 --> 09:02.684
and take good care of me. Mom, Dad.

143
09:04.394 --> 09:05.754
She called me Mom.

144
09:05.824 --> 09:09.064
Honey, did you just call them Mom and Dad?

145
09:09.124 --> 09:11.364
Well, I'm their daughter from now on,

146
09:11.434 --> 09:14.334
so I can call you that, right? Mom, Dad.

147
09:14.404 --> 09:16.774
I can't take it. I have to give you a piggyback ride.

148
09:16.834 --> 09:18.204
- Come here. - Mother.

149
09:18.274 --> 09:19.374
Oh my, let me hug you.

150
09:21.974 --> 09:23.144
Mom.

151
09:33.424 --> 09:35.254
Bring that ramyeon over here when it's done.

152
09:35.324 --> 09:37.894
I'll have it as a snack. Put two eggs in it.

153
09:39.324 --> 09:41.064
This is mine.

154
09:41.124 --> 09:44.364
- Make your own, Father. - Why have you been acting...

155
09:44.434 --> 09:47.934
so grumpy? Did you tag in for Gyu Young...

156
09:48.004 --> 09:49.634
just to nag your father?

157
09:52.804 --> 09:54.644
Why did you cheat in the first place?

158
09:54.704 --> 09:56.244
A man with a wife and kids.

159
09:57.814 --> 10:01.644
Why bring up the cheating whenever you see me?

160
10:01.714 --> 10:02.844
Can't you see your father is...

161
10:02.914 --> 10:03.914
struggling because of Gyu Young?

162
10:03.984 --> 10:05.314
Why would a married man with a family...

163
10:05.384 --> 10:08.054
see another woman?

164
10:08.124 --> 10:11.254
If you hadn't met that woman, you wouldn't have gotten a divorce.

165
10:11.324 --> 10:12.724
If you hadn't met that woman,

166
10:12.794 --> 10:15.864
- none of us would have suffered. - Hey.

167
10:15.924 --> 10:18.834
She's still technically your mother, so don't call her "that woman."

168
10:18.894 --> 10:20.864
Why did you meet her in the first place?

169
10:20.934 --> 10:22.934
I told you, your mother seduced me.

170
10:23.004 --> 10:25.334
They say any tree will fall if you chop it ten times.

171
10:25.404 --> 10:26.744
Your mother chopped at me...

172
10:26.804 --> 10:29.674
- more than 50 times. - Are you a tree, Father?

173
10:29.744 --> 10:31.214
You're a human being with reason and common sense,

174
10:31.274 --> 10:32.914
aren't you?

175
10:32.974 --> 10:34.914
Are you a bird, then?

176
10:34.984 --> 10:36.814
Repeating the same thing over and over again.

177
10:36.884 --> 10:38.954
Are you a parrot?

178
10:39.014 --> 10:41.354
Oh, man.

179
10:41.424 --> 10:43.154
Why are all my kids...

180
10:43.224 --> 10:46.354
so determined to eat their one and only father alive?

181
10:46.424 --> 10:48.024
My blood pressure is rising.

182
10:49.494 --> 10:51.764
I should be the one starting a new family...

183
10:51.834 --> 10:54.364
and getting out of this dump.

184
10:59.404 --> 11:01.474
My stomach hurts.

185
11:01.544 --> 11:02.674
Gosh.

186
11:06.214 --> 11:08.214
My kids are so cheap.

187
11:08.284 --> 11:10.684
They even ate all the canned tuna I had hidden away.

188
11:12.654 --> 11:13.824
What's this?

189
11:16.354 --> 11:18.294
What?

190
11:18.354 --> 11:19.354
What is it?

191
11:24.794 --> 11:25.794
What?

192
11:27.534 --> 11:30.004
Oh my, what is this?

193
11:32.434 --> 11:34.404
Wow.

194
11:36.044 --> 11:40.214
Wow. Oh, hey, what's with this beautiful lunchbox?

195
11:43.314 --> 11:45.054
Someone dropped it off for you to eat.

196
11:45.114 --> 11:46.114
Well, if you had something like this,

197
11:46.184 --> 11:48.484
you should've told me sooner. You really.

198
11:57.634 --> 11:59.064
I know this taste.

199
12:02.704 --> 12:03.904
What?

200
12:06.034 --> 12:09.044
Abalone with yuzu.

201
12:10.544 --> 12:12.574
I've definitely tasted this somewhere before.

202
12:15.414 --> 12:17.554
Oh, I know.

203
12:17.614 --> 12:21.184
Pongdang Restaurant in Samcheok. This is from there, right?

204
12:21.254 --> 12:24.054
This is exactly Mrs. Kang's cooking from Pongdang Restaurant, isn't it?

205
12:24.124 --> 12:25.994
Right?

206
12:26.054 --> 12:27.894
No?

207
12:27.964 --> 12:31.164
Then who is it? Oh!

208
12:31.234 --> 12:32.834
Oh! Poksak Restaurant in Jeju.

209
12:34.264 --> 12:36.504
Hanggu Restaurant in Mokpo.

210
12:36.574 --> 12:38.404
Wait...

211
12:38.474 --> 12:40.874
Then, Nurungji Restaurant in Busan?

212
12:43.104 --> 12:44.244
Which one?

213
12:45.314 --> 12:46.814
Seriously, I've had this before.

214
13:03.794 --> 13:07.164
Gyu Min, Gyu Oh is going to stay at my place for a while.

215
13:07.234 --> 13:10.704
Make up a good excuse so Gyu Rim doesn't worry.

216
13:10.774 --> 13:12.534
Thank you, sir.

217
13:16.774 --> 13:18.514
Thank you so much.

218
13:36.424 --> 13:37.694
I'm coming in.

219
13:54.884 --> 13:57.284
Why don't you stop thinking and get some sleep?

220
14:02.454 --> 14:05.694
There's chamomile tea in the thermos.

221
14:05.754 --> 14:07.594
It'll help if you drink it when you can't sleep.

222
14:17.274 --> 14:19.704
("Cosmos")

223
14:27.414 --> 14:29.544
Books that put you right to sleep.

224
14:29.614 --> 14:32.754
I personally recommend this one.

225
14:57.214 --> 14:59.174
This is a squishy toy Gyeol left behind.

226
14:59.244 --> 15:01.084
Take your anger out on it.

227
15:01.144 --> 15:02.384
It'd be even better if you squeeze it...

228
15:02.444 --> 15:04.714
as hard as your anger and break it.

229
15:04.784 --> 15:07.184
I can just buy Gyeol a new one.

230
15:07.254 --> 15:10.954
Take all your guilt and self-hatred about Han Gyu Oh out on it too.

231
15:11.024 --> 15:13.024
You know how bad self-harm is for your body.

232
15:15.124 --> 15:16.764
I know because I did it for eight years.

233
15:22.864 --> 15:24.204
I do not care about Son Ji Yeol...

234
15:24.274 --> 15:25.474
or the host bar owner.

235
15:25.534 --> 15:28.804
I don't know, let's just sleep for now.

236
15:28.874 --> 15:30.474
Let's think after we sleep.

237
15:30.544 --> 15:33.114
Just close your eyes and sleep first.

238
15:33.174 --> 15:35.084
I'll be guarding the living room.

239
15:35.144 --> 15:37.914
Don't even dream about running away or anything like that.

240
17:06.034 --> 17:08.504
(Tyrannosaurus)

241
17:30.734 --> 17:34.104
That woman must be your mother.

242
17:34.164 --> 17:37.834
She came by last time and asked if you were Gyu Rim.

243
17:37.904 --> 17:39.834
But why did she pretend not to know you...

244
17:39.904 --> 17:41.204
and just leave the lunchbox?

245
18:17.314 --> 18:20.174
I didn't know you were out here. I looked all over for you.

246
18:23.914 --> 18:24.914
Are you okay?

247
18:26.184 --> 18:28.584
You didn't sleep a wink last night and kept tossing and turning.

248
18:29.884 --> 18:31.324
You're going to collapse at this rate.

249
18:37.434 --> 18:39.964
Don't worry too much about Seo Hyun.

250
18:40.034 --> 18:42.904
She's fine. I saw her briefly at the office,

251
18:44.004 --> 18:45.934
and she's doing perfectly fine.

252
18:46.004 --> 18:49.004
Oh, and did I tell you that she left the hotel...

253
18:49.074 --> 18:50.544
and went to Ji Hye's house?

254
18:51.914 --> 18:55.014
Plus, Jung Woo is right there keeping a close eye on her,

255
18:55.084 --> 18:56.684
so please don't worry too much.

256
18:56.744 --> 18:58.284
I packed a lunchbox yesterday...

257
19:00.014 --> 19:01.954
because I wanted to give it to Seo Hyun.

258
19:03.184 --> 19:04.224
Oh, you did?

259
19:07.094 --> 19:09.494
I took it all the way to her office.

260
19:12.164 --> 19:13.934
But no matter how long I waited,

261
19:15.164 --> 19:16.264
I couldn't get in touch with her.

262
19:23.504 --> 19:24.714
So I gave that lunchbox...

263
19:27.244 --> 19:29.084
to Gyu Rim.

264
19:32.484 --> 19:33.514
To Gyu Rim?

265
19:36.624 --> 19:38.294
I made it for Seo Hyun.

266
19:39.394 --> 19:41.894
If Seo Hyun wouldn't take it, I should've just let it go.

267
19:43.994 --> 19:45.364
Why did I...

268
19:47.534 --> 19:50.264
It's not like Gyu Rim is a garbage disposal for leftovers.

269
19:52.804 --> 19:55.604
I went all that way and couldn't even say I was her mother.

270
19:58.074 --> 19:59.544
I was so scared she'd recognise me...

271
20:01.384 --> 20:03.884
that I just ran away.

272
20:08.454 --> 20:10.184
What kind of person am I?

273
20:11.294 --> 20:12.354
Yoon Hee.

274
20:19.294 --> 20:21.634
I don't even know who I am anymore.

275
20:22.704 --> 20:26.404
I'm not Seo Hyun's mother, and I'm not Gyu Rim's mother either.

276
20:29.574 --> 20:32.474
What kind of person am I?

277
20:32.544 --> 20:34.884
Why would you think that?

278
20:34.944 --> 20:38.754
You are Seo Hyun's mother, and you are Gyu Rim's mother too.

279
20:38.814 --> 20:42.184
No matter how much I despised my ex-husband,

280
20:42.254 --> 20:45.124
they're still my own flesh and blood.

281
20:45.194 --> 20:46.524
How could I go 17 years...

282
20:47.624 --> 20:52.034
without contacting them even once, completely ignoring their existence?

283
20:52.094 --> 20:55.604
You did it to raise Seo Hyun well...

284
20:55.664 --> 20:58.504
and be devoted to her.

285
20:58.574 --> 21:00.804
That's why we never had any younger siblings for her.

286
21:02.374 --> 21:03.944
I thought that was the reason.

287
21:06.274 --> 21:07.484
But I don't think it is.

288
21:13.654 --> 21:14.954
More than them...

289
21:16.624 --> 21:19.124
my current life was just too precious to me.

290
21:21.994 --> 21:25.394
The world I'm standing on right now...

291
21:25.464 --> 21:27.904
is already as fragile as a sandcastle.

292
21:29.934 --> 21:32.504
I was terrified they would show up and tear it all down.

293
21:35.404 --> 21:37.674
I think I was just too scared of that.

294
21:45.754 --> 21:47.224
I'm awful, right?

295
21:49.724 --> 21:51.224
I'm disgusting, aren't I?

296
21:53.894 --> 21:55.364
Honey,

297
21:55.424 --> 21:58.394
should we go out for breakfast? Let's not cook.

298
21:58.464 --> 22:00.704
Oh, a hotel. A hotel breakfast sounds nice.

299
22:00.764 --> 22:01.834
Let's go to a hotel.

300
22:03.034 --> 22:04.034
Honey.

301
22:05.734 --> 22:07.444
Please give me some time.

302
22:10.914 --> 22:11.944
I am so sorry to you...

303
22:13.074 --> 22:15.844
that I cannot even look you in the eye, but...

304
22:21.354 --> 22:23.584
Some time to think alone...

305
22:26.294 --> 22:27.294
Please give me that.

306
22:32.094 --> 22:33.264
What does that mean?

307
22:55.984 --> 22:57.084
This girl, seriously.

308
23:02.294 --> 23:04.834
Hey, Han Gyu Young. Who are you trying to ruin now...

309
23:04.894 --> 23:06.234
by putting this all in here together?

310
23:06.294 --> 23:08.464
I told you to do your own laundry. How many times do I have to...

311
23:24.484 --> 23:25.514
Fine, Han Gyu Young.

312
23:26.554 --> 23:28.654
Like you said, you are the one ruining your own life.

313
23:30.594 --> 23:32.154
Live your life however you want.

314
23:35.624 --> 23:36.624
I am done.

315
23:38.464 --> 23:39.594
Just like you wanted,

316
23:41.134 --> 23:43.404
you and I are done here.

317
23:56.314 --> 24:00.354
Hey, I opened my eyes this morning, and I was so shocked.

318
24:00.414 --> 24:03.124
It was not my room in our awful house.

319
24:04.494 --> 24:06.354
Yes. Yes.

320
24:10.164 --> 24:12.094
The maid even brought me freshly squeezed green juice...

321
24:12.164 --> 24:13.594
for room service,

322
24:13.664 --> 24:17.474
and the room has a marble bathroom with a bathtub...

323
24:17.534 --> 24:20.134
and a walk-in closet as big as a playground.

324
24:20.204 --> 24:22.574
Hey, first of all,

325
24:22.644 --> 24:25.914
I love that my family is not in my sight.

326
24:25.974 --> 24:28.014
I do not have to hear their annoying voices,

327
24:28.084 --> 24:30.654
and I do not have to see their tiresome faces.

328
24:30.714 --> 24:32.514
Oh, Se Hee. I will call you back later.

329
24:37.054 --> 24:38.324
What is wrong with your clothes?

330
24:38.394 --> 24:40.124
Why do you think?

331
24:40.194 --> 24:42.264
Did you not even check the size before buying the clothes?

332
24:43.364 --> 24:45.064
No, they said it was the only one left,

333
24:45.134 --> 24:46.634
so I just snatched it up.

334
24:48.804 --> 24:50.904
When that man wore it,

335
24:50.974 --> 24:52.334
it looked incredibly cool.

336
24:52.404 --> 24:54.004
That man?

337
24:54.074 --> 24:56.004
What man?

338
24:56.074 --> 24:57.844
Did you see some man?

339
24:57.914 --> 24:59.514
No, it is not that.

340
24:59.574 --> 25:00.714
Another man was trying to buy it.

341
25:00.784 --> 25:01.784
Hold on a second.

342
25:01.844 --> 25:04.884
Did you perhaps confuse my size with some other guy's size?

343
25:04.954 --> 25:06.814
- Am I you? - I ought to...

344
25:07.784 --> 25:09.024
How dare you yell at me?

345
25:11.324 --> 25:12.324
What is with your hand?

346
25:13.494 --> 25:14.564
Were you trying to hit me just now?

347
25:18.264 --> 25:20.394
Gosh, seriously. This is frustrating.

348
25:21.604 --> 25:22.604
Gosh.

349
25:24.804 --> 25:27.074
Do you hit women?

350
25:28.344 --> 25:30.104
If you do something to deserve it, you should be hit.

351
25:30.174 --> 25:31.774
Hey, my father said...

352
25:32.914 --> 25:34.144
women and dried pollack must be beaten...

353
25:34.214 --> 25:35.614
once every three days.

354
25:35.684 --> 25:36.684
What?

355
25:44.794 --> 25:46.354
Why would you hit me?

356
25:46.424 --> 25:47.864
What gives you the right to hit me?

357
25:47.924 --> 25:50.664
Why would you make a call like that to Se Ra, anyway?

358
25:51.994 --> 25:55.304
Why? Are you embarrassed?

359
25:56.504 --> 25:59.104
You old geezer. Do you not even think of me?

360
26:04.844 --> 26:09.084
What? You bought Se Ra a necklace.

361
26:09.144 --> 26:12.654
And the exact same brand as mine, with the exact same design.

362
26:12.714 --> 26:14.584
Why? Were you afraid you would get confused?

363
26:16.984 --> 26:17.994
Keep quiet and go inside.

364
26:18.054 --> 26:21.394
- Let us talk inside. - Why should I go inside?

365
26:22.664 --> 26:25.264
Gyu Young is going to find out eventually...

366
26:25.334 --> 26:27.934
that her father-in-law is a massive womanizer.

367
26:28.004 --> 26:29.734
Hey. You people.

368
26:31.034 --> 26:32.034
Darn it.

369
26:33.974 --> 26:36.204
Why are you hitting me? Fine, beat me. Beat me.

370
26:37.304 --> 26:39.314
Let us both die today, you jerk.

371
26:40.844 --> 26:43.444
Hey, let go of me. Let go.

372
26:43.514 --> 26:45.484
Who are you texting every night?

373
26:45.554 --> 26:48.454
- Who is it? - Hey. My gosh!

374
26:48.524 --> 26:50.184
Do you not know what privacy is?

375
26:50.184 --> 26:51.954
Why are you looking at someone else's phone?

376
27:17.754 --> 27:19.014
He must have stayed up all night like that.

377
27:20.114 --> 27:23.024
He is giving off samurai vibes, and Joseon swordsman vibes.

378
27:26.794 --> 27:29.664
Wow. Sitting like that, his back must not even hurt.

379
27:29.724 --> 27:32.264
His eyes are still shooting lasers...

380
27:32.334 --> 27:33.964
that look like they could wipe out the world,

381
27:34.034 --> 27:36.304
and he is sitting with his fists clenched like this.

382
27:36.364 --> 27:38.574
If you just put a sword in his hand,

383
27:42.774 --> 27:45.414
he looks like he would unknowingly kill someone.

384
27:49.544 --> 27:50.684
Stay near a bad guy and you get stabbed...

385
27:50.744 --> 27:53.684
You have heard that saying, right? He is dangerous. Very dangerous.

386
27:53.754 --> 27:55.684
You know my intuition is almost at a psychic level, right?

387
27:55.754 --> 27:57.624
Just make up a good excuse and get him out of this house quickly.

388
27:57.694 --> 28:00.454
I told you to go stay at a hotel.

389
28:00.524 --> 28:01.664
Why do you not listen?

390
28:01.724 --> 28:03.094
How can I leave you alone in this dangerous house...

391
28:03.164 --> 28:04.334
and escape by myself?

392
28:04.394 --> 28:05.964
I am telling you, he gives off terrorist vibes.

393
28:07.034 --> 28:09.134
I am the one holding the knife, do I not look dangerous?

394
28:09.204 --> 28:10.504
What?

395
28:10.564 --> 28:15.174
If you insult our goofy Gyu Oh one more time,

396
28:15.244 --> 28:17.204
this knife will not just be chopping green onions.

397
28:17.274 --> 28:18.814
If I call your Gyu Oh a goof ball...

398
28:19.944 --> 28:21.314
twice, you would kill me?

399
28:24.514 --> 28:26.414
Now that you are crazy in love, friends and everything else...

400
28:26.484 --> 28:27.884
are useless.

401
28:29.184 --> 28:31.954
Our 15-year friendship is useless too.

402
28:32.024 --> 28:34.724
Because of that damn family selfishness,

403
28:34.794 --> 28:36.264
our country cannot make it into the G7.

404
28:42.634 --> 28:43.634
Gosh...

405
28:44.734 --> 28:45.734
It is delicious.

406
28:49.304 --> 28:50.404
So annoying.

407
29:10.694 --> 29:11.694
Did you stay up all night like this?

408
29:14.764 --> 29:15.764
Does your back not hurt?

409
29:18.274 --> 29:19.834
Well, I guess you do not want to sit face-to-face with me...

410
29:19.904 --> 29:21.004
and eat right now.

411
29:23.304 --> 29:25.474
The kimchi stew is on the stove, okay?

412
29:25.544 --> 29:27.144
The rice is in the rice cooker,

413
29:27.214 --> 29:28.414
and the side dishes are in the fridge,

414
29:29.784 --> 29:30.784
so help yourself.

415
29:42.524 --> 29:43.524
You are scared of yourself too, right?

416
29:48.534 --> 29:50.304
Because you are scared of yourself, you are...

417
29:50.364 --> 29:51.374
staying completely still like this.

418
29:52.434 --> 29:56.044
If you cause more trouble here, then it cannot be fixed anymore.

419
29:56.104 --> 29:57.174
Because then Gyu Rim will find out too.

420
29:58.944 --> 30:00.374
That is a relief.

421
30:00.444 --> 30:01.714
That you and I have the same destination.

422
30:04.954 --> 30:06.314
That Gyu Rim doesn't cry anymore.

423
30:08.054 --> 30:10.284
That Gyu Rim doesn't get hurt anymore.

424
30:17.264 --> 30:19.334
Let's not stray from the path and just...

425
30:19.394 --> 30:21.204
try to make it to our destination together.

426
30:21.264 --> 30:24.134
As for hitting you yesterday, once we arrive...

427
30:25.374 --> 30:26.404
I'll formally apologize to you then.

428
30:47.664 --> 30:49.964
You will be connected to voicemail.

429
30:49.964 --> 30:53.294
Gosh, Gyu Young. Seriously.

430
30:53.364 --> 30:55.004
She won't answer my calls or read my texts.

431
30:56.004 --> 30:57.434
Being so cold-hearted, she's the exact...

432
30:57.504 --> 30:58.604
spitting image of her mother, I swear.

433
31:01.174 --> 31:02.904
Fine, fine.

434
31:02.974 --> 31:04.444
Let's just say she doesn't exist. She doesn't exist.

435
31:04.514 --> 31:06.774
What? I have 2 sons and 2 daughters.

436
31:06.844 --> 31:08.144
My kids are 2 sons and 2 daughters.

437
31:11.414 --> 31:13.214
Are you going to give this radish kimchi to that guy too?

438
31:16.054 --> 31:19.654
You know, that knockoff. The guy in the tracksuit.

439
31:19.724 --> 31:20.724
No.

440
31:24.264 --> 31:25.764
What's the address of that guy's restaurant?

441
31:26.764 --> 31:28.434
I really need to go check it out with my own eyes.

442
31:28.504 --> 31:30.334
Why would you go there, Father?

443
31:30.404 --> 31:34.004
Well, he might become my son-in-law, so I should look into him properly.

444
31:34.074 --> 31:36.844
See how big the restaurant is, find out what his sales are like.

445
31:36.904 --> 31:39.314
There is absolutely nothing going on between him and me.

446
31:39.374 --> 31:41.144
He's never going to be your son-in-law,

447
31:41.214 --> 31:42.214
so please don't overreact.

448
31:43.744 --> 31:46.184
He says he likes you.

449
31:46.254 --> 31:48.424
And you and Gyeol like him too, apparently.

450
31:48.484 --> 31:49.954
No, we don't.

451
31:50.024 --> 31:53.154
That was in the past, not anymore.

452
31:53.224 --> 31:54.964
He has absolutely nothing to do with me.

453
31:58.934 --> 32:03.234
- He's not a married man, is he? - Father, please.

454
32:03.304 --> 32:05.034
Hey, why are you yelling at me?

455
32:05.104 --> 32:07.204
Am I that easy of a target?

456
32:07.274 --> 32:08.844
Just because I have no money and no job,

457
32:08.904 --> 32:11.044
everyone looks down on me.

458
32:11.114 --> 32:12.274
Even so, I'm the father who brought you...

459
32:12.344 --> 32:14.644
into this world, your father.

460
32:14.714 --> 32:16.044
It's so unfair, it really is.

461
32:18.154 --> 32:20.454
You just got your spit all over the radish kimchi.

462
32:20.514 --> 32:21.524
Since your spit is in this,

463
32:21.584 --> 32:22.724
you have to eat it all yourself, Father.

464
32:24.994 --> 32:25.994
How am I supposed to eat all of this?

465
32:28.894 --> 32:29.964
Hey.

466
32:32.794 --> 32:33.794
How can I eat all this?

467
32:41.674 --> 32:42.674
Hi.

468
32:46.344 --> 32:47.914
This is hot cocoa, but...

469
32:47.984 --> 32:49.614
I bought way too much.

470
32:49.684 --> 32:50.684
Let's share it.

471
32:52.054 --> 32:53.814
I have enough money to buy my own cocoa.

472
32:54.854 --> 32:56.154
I told you, it's just because I bought too much.

473
32:58.624 --> 33:00.424
Well, if I drink all of this by myself...

474
33:00.494 --> 33:02.494
and get a blood sugar spike, will you take responsibility?

475
33:05.134 --> 33:06.434
Fine.

476
33:06.494 --> 33:08.164
Then I'll just take it all home by myself...

477
33:08.234 --> 33:10.134
and drink 30 cups a day.

478
33:10.204 --> 33:12.104
You don't care if someone else gets diabetes...

479
33:12.174 --> 33:13.234
or not, do you?

480
33:17.404 --> 33:18.414
I...

481
33:20.014 --> 33:21.114
I'm not going to you, Mu Jin.

482
33:24.184 --> 33:26.454
I'm absolutely not going.

483
33:29.384 --> 33:30.684
So let's stop this, Mu Jin.

484
33:32.624 --> 33:35.324
Not even nice words, but always mean words,

485
33:36.324 --> 33:37.324
hurtful words.

486
33:38.864 --> 33:39.864
I want to stop doing that too.

487
33:41.864 --> 33:43.604
Please, just let me go, Mu Jin.

488
33:45.204 --> 33:46.604
No.

489
33:46.674 --> 33:47.674
Mu Jin.

490
33:47.734 --> 33:50.174
Mean words, painful words, hurtful words.

491
33:50.244 --> 33:51.244
Say them all you want.

492
33:53.014 --> 33:54.544
Just do not get hurt by your own words.

493
33:58.084 --> 33:59.984
Still, I wanted to see you for a long time today,

494
34:01.114 --> 34:02.354
so I put some effort into my appearance...

495
34:04.154 --> 34:05.854
You could at least think about my effort...

496
34:05.924 --> 34:06.924
and be a little nice to me, can you not?

497
34:08.494 --> 34:09.494
Even for just five minutes.

498
34:19.204 --> 34:21.874
(456 Geumje-dong 4ga)

499
34:21.944 --> 34:24.104
If you think I will get tired of this,

500
34:24.174 --> 34:25.674
you should drop that thought.

501
34:26.914 --> 34:28.314
Even if rejected every day, I will keep trying.

502
34:31.954 --> 34:33.354
I will never be an idiot again and...

503
34:33.414 --> 34:34.684
I will never lose you again.

504
34:36.454 --> 34:39.154
(456 Geumje-dong 4ga)

505
34:59.114 --> 35:01.314
Yes, you called, Grandma?

506
35:01.384 --> 35:03.884
I was in class, so I could not answer. I am sorry.

507
35:03.944 --> 35:07.554
Hee Na, I heard you are dating a thug these days.

508
35:07.614 --> 35:08.624
A thug?

509
35:11.424 --> 35:12.694
A thug?

510
35:12.754 --> 35:14.824
Do not even think about denying it, okay?

511
35:14.894 --> 35:17.694
I heard it clearly from Gyu Oh.

512
35:17.764 --> 35:20.064
Oh, this is so warm.

513
35:21.334 --> 35:23.864
It feels like my blood circulation is improving all on its own.

514
35:27.834 --> 35:30.244
Did Gyu Oh really say that?

515
35:30.304 --> 35:32.244
That I am dating a thug these days?

516
35:32.314 --> 35:33.844
He did, you know?

517
35:33.914 --> 35:36.884
He said there's this crazy thug, right?

518
35:36.944 --> 35:41.684
And this guy does not know his place and likes you an awful lot, Hee Na.

519
35:41.754 --> 35:44.794
And he said you are also completely head over heels for him.

520
35:44.854 --> 35:47.054
He said I should call your parents right away...

521
35:47.124 --> 35:49.594
to teach that thug a lesson...

522
35:49.664 --> 35:52.294
and tear you two apart. What should I do?

523
35:52.364 --> 35:55.204
Should I tell your parents...

524
35:55.264 --> 35:57.934
about this shocking news?

525
35:58.004 --> 35:59.404
No.

526
35:59.474 --> 36:03.174
Han Gyu Oh does not know anything and misspoke.

527
36:03.244 --> 36:06.074
The person I am dating right now is not a thug.

528
36:06.144 --> 36:07.144
He is really cool, kind,

529
36:07.214 --> 36:09.414
- and a good person, Grandma. - Excuse me.

530
36:09.484 --> 36:10.484
Could you turn up the temperature...

531
36:10.544 --> 36:13.054
- a little higher? - Yes.

532
36:15.024 --> 36:18.724
Oh my. Goodness, this is amazing.

533
36:18.794 --> 36:22.364
My muscles are all relaxing, and my whole body is melting.

534
36:23.724 --> 36:25.694
Where was I?

535
36:25.764 --> 36:27.794
Anyway, never mind that.

536
36:27.864 --> 36:30.064
Before I contact your parents,

537
36:30.134 --> 36:33.504
you need to break up with that thug right this instant.

538
36:33.574 --> 36:36.044
I am telling you, he is not a thug.

539
36:36.104 --> 36:38.674
You will like him too when you see him.

540
36:38.744 --> 36:41.784
You said it yourself before. You vouch for...

541
36:45.484 --> 36:48.084
Anyway, I cannot tell you right now,

542
36:49.084 --> 36:51.324
but please wait just a little bit.

543
36:51.394 --> 36:54.424
- If you wait just a little bit... - Oh my?

544
36:54.494 --> 36:57.894
You are already completely blinded by love.

545
36:57.964 --> 36:59.464
I really need to call your parents...

546
36:59.534 --> 37:02.904
- or step in myself. - Grandma.

547
37:02.964 --> 37:08.004
If you really want to date someone, do not date some random guy.

548
37:08.074 --> 37:09.904
You should see Gyu Oh instead.

549
37:11.204 --> 37:12.214
Gyu Oh?

550
37:13.974 --> 37:16.614
What? Is it already over?

551
37:16.684 --> 37:19.714
- Yes, it is over. - Could I do it just one more time?

552
37:20.784 --> 37:23.984
It feels so good that I do not want to get up.

553
37:24.054 --> 37:25.054
Yes, go ahead.

554
37:26.094 --> 37:28.794
Thank you. So, what do you say?

555
37:28.864 --> 37:29.864
Do you not like Gyu Oh?

556
37:30.964 --> 37:34.264
You are saying that because you do not know him well.

557
37:34.334 --> 37:36.864
He might not have a decent job yet,

558
37:36.934 --> 37:40.434
but a job is something he can just find.

559
37:40.504 --> 37:43.304
He will never let you go hungry, Hee Na.

560
37:43.374 --> 37:45.414
He is the kind of guy who will provide for you.

561
37:45.474 --> 37:49.044
For a young man, he is thoughtful and hardworking.

562
37:49.114 --> 37:52.514
He is kind and knows how to respect his elders.

563
37:52.584 --> 37:54.984
Compared to that total thug you are seeing,

564
37:55.054 --> 37:59.854
he is 100, no, 1,000 times better.

565
37:59.924 --> 38:04.494
Oh, I told you before. Right after our Heung Sik,

566
38:04.564 --> 38:06.334
he is the one guy I can personally vouch for.

567
38:07.394 --> 38:09.834
Yes, you did.

568
38:09.904 --> 38:12.834
You said that since you vouch for him,

569
38:12.904 --> 38:14.474
I can rest assured.

570
38:14.534 --> 38:18.674
I have matchmake five couples so far.

571
38:18.744 --> 38:21.884
They had babies as cute as bunnies,

572
38:21.944 --> 38:24.954
and you have no idea how well they are all living.

573
38:25.014 --> 38:26.454
I understand, Grandma.

574
38:26.514 --> 38:29.254
I will break up with that thug right away,

575
38:29.324 --> 38:32.524
so please make sure to set me up with Han Gyu Oh.

576
38:33.724 --> 38:34.724
Yes, yes.

577
38:35.794 --> 38:38.734
Oh my, you made a great decision.

578
38:38.794 --> 38:40.634
Yes, yes, do not worry.

579
38:40.694 --> 38:41.934
Thank you, Grandma.

580
38:45.174 --> 38:46.704
Oh my.

581
38:48.644 --> 38:52.774
Wow, lying here in peace,

582
38:52.844 --> 38:55.884
I just saved a girl who was about to go to ruin.

583
38:55.944 --> 38:57.184
Oh my.

584
38:58.654 --> 39:02.454
Oh, right. Your nephew. No, no. I mean, our boss...

585
39:02.524 --> 39:03.524
he is going to the US...

586
39:03.584 --> 39:07.394
because of his kids. Is that confirmed by any chance?

587
39:07.454 --> 39:08.594
Yes, he is going.

588
39:10.064 --> 39:12.364
So I am...

589
39:12.434 --> 39:14.564
thinking of taking over this store.

590
39:17.134 --> 39:18.604
With something this good,

591
39:18.674 --> 39:20.474
how could I let someone else have it?

592
39:22.144 --> 39:24.974
Let us stick together until the end. Please help me out.

593
39:25.044 --> 39:27.474
Let us do this together, Director Song.

594
39:27.544 --> 39:29.714
Yes, ma'am.

595
39:34.714 --> 39:36.284
Wow, Han Gyu Oh.

596
39:37.284 --> 39:38.524
What were you even thinking,

597
39:38.594 --> 39:40.794
trying to tattle on me to my parents?

598
39:42.994 --> 39:44.124
Gosh, seriously.

599
39:56.174 --> 39:58.104
(Kwon Hee Na)

600
40:08.984 --> 40:11.854
The call cannot be connected, so you will be connected to voicemail.

601
40:11.924 --> 40:13.054
Why is he not answering?

602
40:16.294 --> 40:17.394
(Are you busy? You must be really busy.)

603
40:17.464 --> 40:18.664
(Han Gyu Oh? Hello?)

604
40:19.134 --> 40:20.494
The number one is not disappearing.

605
40:26.774 --> 40:29.374
You're not answering your phone. You're not reading my messages.

606
40:31.174 --> 40:33.944
Are you sick? Did something happen to you?

607
40:35.814 --> 40:36.814
What?

608
40:36.884 --> 40:38.984
I am going crazy with worry, so please call me back soon.

609
40:39.054 --> 40:40.284
(Communication, Sharing, Rainbow Dreams)

610
40:41.354 --> 40:43.054
And no matter what happens between us,

611
40:43.124 --> 40:44.584
I think we are meant to be,

612
40:44.654 --> 40:46.354
so just give up and surrender, Han Gyu Oh.

613
41:07.314 --> 41:09.714
Hey, you are spilling it.

614
41:09.784 --> 41:11.284
Thank you, Gyu Seo.

615
41:11.344 --> 41:13.184
No way, seriously.

616
41:14.414 --> 41:15.524
This is so good.

617
41:25.294 --> 41:28.094
- What is this? - What do you think it is?

618
41:28.164 --> 41:30.404
Does the name sound like a brand name to you?

619
41:30.464 --> 41:32.234
Ha Yo Won, Lee Hyo Jin, Gong Su Jeong, Lim Mi Na,

620
41:32.304 --> 41:34.774
Shin Ye Seul, Han Yi Seul, Kim Chae Won, Moon Ji Won...

621
41:34.834 --> 41:36.574
Gosh.

622
41:36.644 --> 41:37.644
Did you get the message?

623
41:41.544 --> 41:42.784
What is this?

624
41:42.844 --> 41:45.284
The names of the girls who told me to give this to you.

625
41:45.354 --> 41:46.914
Am I your delivery service?

626
41:46.984 --> 41:48.084
You should have said I wouldn't accept it.

627
41:48.154 --> 41:49.824
Why did you go through the trouble of bringing it?

628
41:49.884 --> 41:51.054
Even earlier, I had a huge pile of these...

629
41:51.124 --> 41:52.254
and I gave them all away to the other kids.

630
41:52.324 --> 41:55.094
Yes, you are such a big shot.

631
41:58.434 --> 42:01.364
Let's step outside for a second. I have something to tell you.

632
42:01.434 --> 42:03.734
Me too. I have something to tell you too.

633
42:07.534 --> 42:09.074
- What do you want to talk about? - You go first.

634
42:09.144 --> 42:11.244
- You go first. - You are older, so you go first.

635
42:11.304 --> 42:13.574
You brought it up first, so you go.

636
42:13.644 --> 42:16.014
Okay, fine. Then let's say it at the same time.

637
42:17.514 --> 42:19.714
In 3, 2, 1.

638
42:19.784 --> 42:21.984
- You are hiding something, right? - You are hiding something, right?

639
42:22.054 --> 42:23.284
- What is it? - What is it?

640
42:23.284 --> 42:24.554
- Don't even think about lying. - Don't even think about lying.

641
42:26.754 --> 42:28.054
Okay, okay.

642
42:28.124 --> 42:30.524
- I will just go first. - No, I will go first.

643
42:30.594 --> 42:32.364
Alright, you go first, then.

644
42:34.864 --> 42:36.464
No, you go first.

645
42:36.534 --> 42:38.504
Let's say it at the same time again, then.

646
42:38.574 --> 42:40.574
In 3, 2, 1.

647
42:40.634 --> 42:42.604
- I told Mu Jin about Gyu Oh. - I met Gyu Rim's biological mother.

648
42:42.674 --> 42:44.074
I even got her phone number.

649
42:44.144 --> 42:46.174
You met Gyu Rim's biological mother?

650
42:46.244 --> 42:49.944
- And you got her phone number? - You told Mu Jin about Gyu Oh?

651
42:50.014 --> 42:51.014
How much did you tell him?

652
42:58.994 --> 43:01.624
She didn't even tell Gyu Rim...

653
43:01.694 --> 43:03.124
that she was her mother before leaving?

654
43:03.194 --> 43:04.524
After coming all that way? Why?

655
43:06.034 --> 43:07.894
I don't know about that.

656
43:07.964 --> 43:09.364
Gyu Rim's mother remarried...

657
43:09.434 --> 43:11.304
and seems to have a family of her own.

658
43:11.364 --> 43:12.804
Abandoning such a beautiful wife...

659
43:12.874 --> 43:14.634
for a woman who looks like a witch...

660
43:14.704 --> 43:16.204
Is our dad completely crazy?

661
43:16.274 --> 43:18.944
How do you know she looks like a witch?

662
43:19.014 --> 43:20.344
You don't even know what our mom looks like.

663
43:20.414 --> 43:23.044
What kind of mother is she? A woman like that.

664
43:23.114 --> 43:24.444
When you were little, you used to run away from home...

665
43:24.514 --> 43:26.284
and cause a scene looking for her.

666
43:26.354 --> 43:27.384
Do you know how hard it was for Gyu Rim...

667
43:27.454 --> 43:29.954
- because of you? - Me?

668
43:30.024 --> 43:31.024
When?

669
43:32.324 --> 43:33.854
I never did that.

670
43:33.924 --> 43:36.194
All right. End of discussion.

671
43:37.624 --> 43:40.594
So did you tell Mom that you are Han Gyu Seo?

672
43:42.604 --> 43:44.104
No.

673
43:44.164 --> 43:46.174
I lied and said I was Kim Gyu Seo for now.

674
43:46.234 --> 43:47.274
Were you afraid she'd know who you are...

675
43:47.334 --> 43:50.444
if you said Han Gyu Seo? What if she knew?

676
43:53.914 --> 43:57.844
"So you are that witch's son." "You son of my enemy."

677
43:57.914 --> 43:59.214
"You are dead to me today."

678
43:59.284 --> 44:00.584
Were you afraid she would curse and hit you?

679
44:02.724 --> 44:05.154
Why did you tell Mr. Mu Jin about Gyu Oh?

680
44:07.194 --> 44:08.694
I do not know either.

681
44:08.764 --> 44:10.294
He caught me crying because I was upset...

682
44:10.364 --> 44:12.164
about Gyu Oh.

683
44:12.234 --> 44:14.264
How could you tell him everything just because he caught you?

684
44:16.664 --> 44:18.534
The sunlight was so warm...

685
44:18.604 --> 44:20.934
how could the traveller not take off his coat?

686
44:21.004 --> 44:22.174
What are you talking about?

687
44:22.244 --> 44:25.744
Mr. Mu Jin is so reliable and warm...

688
44:25.814 --> 44:28.444
I just started blabbing without even realising it.

689
44:28.514 --> 44:29.914
You know that if there is one thing about me,

690
44:29.984 --> 44:31.884
it is that I can keep a secret, right?

691
44:31.954 --> 44:33.514
I was shocked myself after I told him everything.

692
44:36.024 --> 44:37.384
Think about what happened with Gyeol.

693
44:37.454 --> 44:39.254
What would we have done without Mr. Mu Jin?

694
44:40.254 --> 44:44.694
Now Mr. Mu Jin feels like family, like an older brother.

695
44:44.764 --> 44:46.364
He is like a guardian presence for our family.

696
44:47.794 --> 44:48.934
So,

697
44:49.004 --> 44:51.064
is Gyu Oh at Mr. Mu Jin's place right now?

698
44:51.134 --> 44:52.704
And he lied to Gyu Rim about going on a trip?

699
45:05.214 --> 45:06.814
If you do something to deserve it, you should be hit.

700
45:08.284 --> 45:09.324
Hey, my father said...

701
45:09.324 --> 45:10.324
women and dried pollack must be beaten...

702
45:10.384 --> 45:11.824
once every three days.

703
45:15.394 --> 45:17.364
Let us both die today, you jerk.

704
45:18.964 --> 45:20.294
Hey, let go of me. Let go.

705
45:20.364 --> 45:23.734
Hey, let go. Who are you texting every night?

706
45:23.804 --> 45:25.734
- Who is it? - Hey. My gosh!

707
45:25.804 --> 45:27.974
Do you not know what privacy is?

708
45:27.974 --> 45:30.104
Why are you looking at someone else's phone?

709
45:39.884 --> 45:41.114
Customer number 15,

710
45:41.184 --> 45:44.224
- your iced Americano is ready. - Yes.

711
45:49.494 --> 45:50.794
Thank you.

712
45:55.404 --> 45:56.664
I am sorry.

713
45:56.734 --> 46:00.034
It is a shame, but this time, I do not think I can go to Milan.

714
46:01.274 --> 46:03.404
I know. Instead,

715
46:03.474 --> 46:06.374
I will definitely go to Paris no matter what.

716
46:09.114 --> 46:13.584
Okay. It is time for my guest to arrive...

717
46:13.654 --> 46:15.524
Let's talk later.

718
46:15.584 --> 46:16.584
Have a good day.

719
46:20.594 --> 46:22.264
You are here?

720
46:22.324 --> 46:23.464
Oh, my.

721
46:23.524 --> 46:25.594
What is with this super old-school setup?

722
46:26.694 --> 46:28.434
I knew you would bring it back.

723
46:28.494 --> 46:31.134
How could a size that fits me fit Sung Wook?

724
46:32.274 --> 46:34.774
Oh, but did we not agree to meet at three o'clock?

725
46:34.834 --> 46:36.174
Do you have other plans besides me?

726
46:36.244 --> 46:38.744
No, I do not have any other plans.

727
46:38.814 --> 46:41.574
I do not think so. I think you got the time wrong.

728
46:43.214 --> 46:45.954
Oh, were you planning to pick up women here?

729
46:46.014 --> 46:48.584
- Should I get out of your way? - What are you talking about?

730
46:48.654 --> 46:50.184
Just give me back those clothes.

731
46:51.584 --> 46:54.524
Memorizing foreign words you do not even understand to flirt...

732
46:54.594 --> 46:58.324
is a completely Stone Age tactic. Jo Heung Sik.

733
46:58.394 --> 47:01.264
With such a cheap and outdated sense of style,

734
47:01.334 --> 47:03.764
are you trying to seduce a caveman?

735
47:03.834 --> 47:07.634
Save all that nonsense for when you go home...

736
47:07.704 --> 47:09.344
and just hand over the shopping bag.

737
47:11.474 --> 47:14.644
What you want to do and what you can do...

738
47:14.714 --> 47:18.284
are two different things. If you want to be happy,

739
47:18.344 --> 47:21.554
please stick to what you can actually do.

740
47:23.624 --> 47:25.024
Do you need me to translate that for you?

741
47:29.564 --> 47:31.124
Right.

742
47:31.194 --> 47:32.194
You are right.

743
47:33.494 --> 47:36.364
You cannot have everything just because you want it,

744
47:36.434 --> 47:41.004
and having everything does not make you happy either.

745
47:42.404 --> 47:44.274
But...

746
47:44.344 --> 47:46.044
When will you ever grow up?

747
47:52.484 --> 47:53.654
Sitting with a married woman for too long...

748
47:53.714 --> 47:55.114
will only cause unnecessary misunderstandings.

749
47:55.184 --> 47:56.184
I will get going.

750
48:01.094 --> 48:05.494
Oh, and by the way, my mom saw your mom,

751
48:05.564 --> 48:08.494
and she said she was cold, distant, and heartless,

752
48:08.564 --> 48:12.404
exactly like a carbon copy of you.

753
48:12.474 --> 48:14.704
Is your nasty attitude the power of genetics?

754
48:14.774 --> 48:17.374
What do you mean by that? Where did she see my mom?

755
48:19.674 --> 48:20.874
I asked where she saw her.

756
48:29.254 --> 48:32.754
(Suragan Side Dishes)

757
48:35.194 --> 48:36.594
Why did Mom come to see you?

758
48:38.734 --> 48:41.394
I am asking why Mom came to see you.

759
48:41.464 --> 48:43.204
She was so cold to me,

760
48:43.264 --> 48:45.434
so what is her reason for visiting you?

761
48:45.504 --> 48:46.774
What did Mom say?

762
48:46.834 --> 48:48.234
Did she see you living in this pathetic state...

763
48:48.304 --> 48:49.344
and offer you money?

764
48:49.404 --> 48:50.474
Did she offer you a few hundred thousand?

765
48:50.544 --> 48:51.944
Did she say she would give you a building?

766
48:53.114 --> 48:55.244
Please be quiet, ma'am.

767
48:55.314 --> 48:58.114
If you yell one more time, I will call the police.

768
49:00.684 --> 49:02.454
Darn it.

769
49:02.524 --> 49:04.324
I asked how much Mom said she would give you.

770
49:12.134 --> 49:13.864
Han Gyu Rim.

771
49:13.934 --> 49:14.934
Darn it.

772
49:16.034 --> 49:19.974
Hey, can you not hear me? Hey, hello.

773
49:20.034 --> 49:22.874
Hey, what did Mom say she would give you.

774
49:24.144 --> 49:26.514
- I do not have a mom. - What?

775
49:26.574 --> 49:30.244
Because my mom died a long time ago. If you want to talk about your mom,

776
49:30.314 --> 49:35.254
go talk to your siblings, ma'am. Stop chattering so loudly in here.

777
49:35.314 --> 49:36.384
Gosh.

778
49:36.454 --> 49:38.654
It is so offensive how you keep calling me ma'am.

779
49:38.724 --> 49:40.524
You really are cutting ties for good.

780
49:40.594 --> 49:42.624
Fine, if we are cutting ties,

781
49:42.694 --> 49:44.794
let us do it properly so there is no lingering affection.

782
49:44.864 --> 49:48.164
Gyeol's Mom. That is exactly what I want, too.

783
49:48.234 --> 49:49.564
Gyeol's Mom.

784
49:49.634 --> 49:50.734
If we bump into each other on the street,

785
49:50.804 --> 49:53.504
just try acting like you know me. Gyeol's Mom.

786
49:53.574 --> 49:54.574
Darn it.

787
50:04.314 --> 50:07.714
If I ever find out later that Mom gave you anything,

788
50:07.784 --> 50:11.184
I will not let it slide. I will sue you.

789
50:11.254 --> 50:12.254
Gosh.

790
50:19.494 --> 50:20.894
She just left a lunchbox.

791
50:22.364 --> 50:23.364
Why?

792
50:24.964 --> 50:26.374
She was afraid I would find out she is my mom,

793
50:27.534 --> 50:28.844
so she even came wearing sunglasses.

794
50:31.044 --> 50:32.214
Not one year,

795
50:33.344 --> 50:34.514
not two years,

796
50:37.044 --> 50:38.884
but showing up after 17 years...

797
50:42.584 --> 50:45.054
A mother should not do that to her child.

798
50:46.694 --> 50:47.694
A mother...

799
50:49.294 --> 50:50.764
cannot do that.

800
50:53.464 --> 50:54.794
She is still my mom, though.

801
50:56.864 --> 50:58.034
She is my mom.

802
51:38.604 --> 51:41.114
This sports line maintains our existing functionality...

803
51:41.174 --> 51:42.514
while being perfectly suited for everyday wear,

804
51:42.584 --> 51:45.184
with a lifewear and stylewear concept in mind.

805
51:47.984 --> 51:48.984
As you have seen,

806
51:49.054 --> 51:50.654
we aimed to showcase a wider variety of styles...

807
51:50.724 --> 51:53.024
this fall, and we expect the customer response...

808
51:53.094 --> 51:55.964
to be just as positive. Accordingly, we have also...

809
51:56.024 --> 51:57.394
secured a stable supply of inventory.

810
51:59.264 --> 52:02.734
So that each store can achieve great results this season,

811
52:02.804 --> 52:05.674
we will also do our best. That is all.

812
52:07.804 --> 52:09.804
Excuse me, can I try this on?

813
52:17.344 --> 52:19.684
Oh, this is very nice.

814
52:19.754 --> 52:21.954
Please secure inventory for this one.

815
52:22.014 --> 52:23.824
- Yes, understood. - Us, too.

816
52:27.554 --> 52:29.164
Well, the response is not bad.

817
52:32.534 --> 52:33.894
I thought you would drop work and everything else...

818
52:33.964 --> 52:35.934
and run away somewhere, to hide.

819
52:37.164 --> 52:39.634
I know how to separate my personal and professional life.

820
52:39.704 --> 52:40.704
Is that so?

821
52:41.834 --> 52:44.204
I am glad you did not take after me in that regard.

822
52:44.274 --> 52:46.214
If you have nothing else to say, I will take my leave.

823
52:47.644 --> 52:48.844
Your mother left home.

824
52:54.884 --> 52:56.024
I do not know where she is right now.

825
52:58.424 --> 53:02.464
Well, you left once, and I left once, so, to be fair,

826
53:02.524 --> 53:04.224
I guess it was your mother's turn to leave.

827
53:07.834 --> 53:09.764
Are you two getting a divorce?

828
53:11.304 --> 53:12.304
Well...

829
53:15.944 --> 53:19.044
Your mother seems to be considering it,

830
53:19.114 --> 53:20.114
but I do not know.

831
53:21.974 --> 53:23.144
It is not because of you.

832
53:24.384 --> 53:26.184
Okay?

833
53:26.254 --> 53:29.124
It probably will not happen, but even if it does,

834
53:29.184 --> 53:30.324
it is not because of you.

835
53:33.924 --> 53:37.024
Anyway, stop burdening your friend...

836
53:38.194 --> 53:39.234
and come home.

837
53:42.364 --> 53:43.364
Seo Hyun.

838
53:44.434 --> 53:45.774
I really don't know.

839
53:46.934 --> 53:48.674
What it means to be a parent...

840
53:48.734 --> 53:49.904
or what it means to be a child.

841
53:57.484 --> 53:59.984
I'm heading out, so please get the car ready.

842
54:01.514 --> 54:02.524
Dad.

843
54:04.284 --> 54:05.924
Write up the report and submit it by tomorrow.

844
54:19.834 --> 54:21.404
- Welcome. - Hello.

845
54:27.974 --> 54:29.914
Why are you drinking in broad daylight?

846
54:31.144 --> 54:32.614
You're here?

847
54:32.684 --> 54:33.684
Have a seat.

848
54:38.424 --> 54:39.524
Thank you.

849
54:41.024 --> 54:42.694
Do you happen to believe in fortune-telling?

850
54:44.624 --> 54:46.194
I completely believe in it.

851
54:47.264 --> 54:48.264
Clink.

852
54:51.404 --> 54:52.534
They said my fortune...

853
54:53.904 --> 54:55.274
has a sword in it.

854
54:56.804 --> 55:01.114
That's why I cut off my son...

855
55:01.174 --> 55:04.344
and severed ties with my friend of 40 years.

856
55:04.414 --> 55:06.914
Oh, me too.

857
55:06.984 --> 55:09.684
They said my fortune has scissors in it,

858
55:09.754 --> 55:12.124
so I get cut off by everyone close to me...

859
55:18.024 --> 55:20.794
If it's a friend of 40 years,

860
55:20.864 --> 55:23.304
that's a best friend you've known longer than your son.

861
55:23.364 --> 55:25.464
Why did you go as far as cutting ties?

862
55:28.234 --> 55:30.374
Because he was talking such nonsense.

863
55:31.474 --> 55:33.344
As if ruining his own life wasn't enough,

864
55:33.414 --> 55:35.474
why would he try to ruin someone else's son's life?

865
55:35.544 --> 55:37.314
That jerk.

866
55:37.384 --> 55:40.014
How could he offer his wife's daughter...

867
55:40.084 --> 55:42.184
to my son?

868
55:44.154 --> 55:47.254
If it's his wife's daughter, isn't it his own daughter?

869
55:50.764 --> 55:51.824
Well, anyway...

870
55:53.234 --> 55:54.764
The more I think about it, the angrier I get.

871
55:58.304 --> 56:00.604
Both my son and my friend.

872
56:02.174 --> 56:05.004
How could they all do this to me?

873
56:06.274 --> 56:07.744
Are all men like this?

874
56:07.814 --> 56:11.214
When they go crazy over a woman, do they lose their minds?

875
56:11.284 --> 56:13.954
Well, I don't have any experience with that.

876
56:15.114 --> 56:18.754
But I do understand that feeling of betrayal.

877
56:18.824 --> 56:22.194
I've been stabbed in the back so many times.

878
56:22.254 --> 56:25.364
I've been betrayed and backstabbed so often.

879
56:25.424 --> 56:29.134
By the guy I met through business, my son, and my friend.

880
56:38.204 --> 56:39.214
I know some guys...

881
56:40.514 --> 56:43.244
who will never betray you.

882
56:44.444 --> 56:45.514
Should I introduce you?

883
57:06.374 --> 57:07.704
Awesome.

884
57:09.504 --> 57:12.474
These guys will absolutely never betray you.

885
57:12.544 --> 57:15.074
Is there anything else you like?

886
57:15.144 --> 57:19.044
- How about that pink one? - What exactly do you do?

887
57:19.114 --> 57:22.984
Some people even call me Santa Claus.

888
57:23.054 --> 57:25.954
You said your name was Seok Joong, right?

889
57:26.024 --> 57:27.594
You remembered.

890
57:27.654 --> 57:30.564
I should at least remember your name if we are going to be friends.

891
57:30.624 --> 57:32.894
Let's just be friends. No.

892
57:32.964 --> 57:34.794
Here, let's be friends.

893
57:34.864 --> 57:36.534
Well, it's a two-year difference, so why not?

894
57:36.604 --> 57:37.704
Let's be friends.

895
57:38.704 --> 57:39.774
Friend.

896
57:40.974 --> 57:44.604
- But what is your name, friend? - Me?

897
57:49.484 --> 57:51.814
(Gyu Rim)

898
57:56.224 --> 57:58.084
(Gyu Rim)

899
58:15.274 --> 58:17.244
(Gyu Rim)

900
58:24.614 --> 58:27.084
(Gyu Rim)

901
58:27.154 --> 58:29.854
Are you enjoying your trip?

902
58:29.924 --> 58:33.624
Are you eating well?

903
58:33.694 --> 58:35.624
I heard the temperature drops at night,

904
58:35.694 --> 58:37.694
so be careful not to catch a cold.

905
58:44.964 --> 58:46.674
Nothing is wrong, right?

906
58:47.974 --> 58:50.174
For someone who doesn't even like travelling...

907
58:50.244 --> 58:52.204
to suddenly go on a trip...

908
58:53.944 --> 58:55.444
Honestly...

909
58:55.514 --> 58:56.944
I am worried.

910
58:58.914 --> 59:01.184
I am afraid someone might take my Gyu Oh away.

911
59:01.254 --> 59:04.224
I am afraid someone might ask you to be their brother.

912
59:05.824 --> 59:07.794
I am really worried.

913
59:07.854 --> 59:09.194
That will be 24 dollars.

914
59:09.254 --> 59:12.624
Even if a more capable and cooler woman appears...

915
59:12.694 --> 59:15.464
and offers to buy you snacks and bread,

916
59:15.534 --> 59:17.964
do not ever be swayed...

917
59:18.034 --> 59:21.134
and come back home to me...

918
59:21.204 --> 59:23.044
right away.

919
59:23.104 --> 59:26.044
Run back without looking back.

920
59:26.114 --> 59:30.144
I will do much, much better from now on.

921
59:31.214 --> 59:32.214
Gyu Oh.

922
59:46.634 --> 59:47.864
I am sorry, Gyu Rim.

923
01:00:27.504 --> 01:00:28.604
Do you want a fried egg?

924
01:00:31.774 --> 01:00:34.414
Hey, slow down. I am not going to steal it.

925
01:00:39.514 --> 01:00:40.614
I am not going to die.

926
01:00:41.854 --> 01:00:42.954
I am going to live.

927
01:00:44.454 --> 01:00:45.524
Who said otherwise?

928
01:00:50.194 --> 01:00:53.134
I am never going to die. I will not die even if it kills me.

929
01:00:55.994 --> 01:00:58.304
Hey, but I am starving to death.

930
01:00:58.364 --> 01:00:59.804
You did not eat it all, right?

931
01:00:59.874 --> 01:01:01.834
- I ate it all. - What?

932
01:01:06.614 --> 01:01:08.114
- Hey. - There is nothing there.

933
01:01:09.984 --> 01:01:11.984
(456 Geumje-dong 4ga)

934
01:01:16.524 --> 01:01:17.524
Gyu Rim.

935
01:01:20.254 --> 01:01:21.854
What?

936
01:01:21.924 --> 01:01:23.324
Gyu Min told me...

937
01:01:23.394 --> 01:01:25.464
you went on a trip to Namhae and would be back in a week.

938
01:01:26.834 --> 01:01:28.864
I was going to come back in a week,

939
01:01:28.934 --> 01:01:30.604
but some weird woman showed up...

940
01:01:30.664 --> 01:01:32.364
and tried to tempt me by offering to buy me snacks and bread,

941
01:01:32.434 --> 01:01:34.974
asking me to be her brother.

942
01:01:35.034 --> 01:01:36.574
Then I remembered you told me to come back right away,

943
01:01:36.644 --> 01:01:38.174
to run back without looking back.

944
01:01:40.744 --> 01:01:41.974
So I ran back as fast as I could.

945
01:01:46.184 --> 01:01:47.354
What happened to your face?

946
01:01:48.984 --> 01:01:51.054
Where did you get hurt?

947
01:01:51.124 --> 01:01:52.384
Who did this?

948
01:01:58.264 --> 01:01:59.734
Something happened, right?

949
01:02:03.804 --> 01:02:05.234
A lot of things happened.

950
01:02:06.934 --> 01:02:07.934
Like what?

951
01:02:09.104 --> 01:02:10.374
What happened?

952
01:02:12.874 --> 01:02:14.774
It is too long to explain right now.

953
01:02:16.044 --> 01:02:19.014
I am dead tired right now, so tired I cannot say another word.

954
01:02:23.824 --> 01:02:24.824
Gyu Oh.

955
01:02:24.884 --> 01:02:26.854
Not today, but at your birthday party when you turn 100.

956
01:02:28.094 --> 01:02:29.354
Can I answer you then?

957
01:02:43.104 --> 01:02:44.104
Okay.

958
01:02:45.944 --> 01:02:46.944
You can do that.

959
01:02:49.044 --> 01:02:50.484
To hear your answer,

960
01:02:50.544 --> 01:02:52.784
I will have to live a very long time, right?

961
01:02:56.824 --> 01:02:58.354
It is enough that you came back.

962
01:03:00.994 --> 01:03:02.324
Coming back safely like this...

963
01:03:03.524 --> 01:03:04.864
is all that matters.

964
01:03:07.764 --> 01:03:09.494
This is enough for today, Gyu Oh.

965
01:03:13.074 --> 01:03:14.334
You have been through a lot.

966
01:03:16.174 --> 01:03:17.174
Welcome home.

967
01:04:20.834 --> 01:04:22.304
(Love on the Menu)

968
01:04:22.374 --> 01:04:24.374
You should give up on my brother, Ms. Kwon.

969
01:04:24.444 --> 01:04:26.274
You told me not to give up before.

970
01:04:26.274 --> 01:04:28.114
But he will not give up.

971
01:04:28.174 --> 01:04:30.344
I think I was scammed into this marriage.

972
01:04:30.414 --> 01:04:31.484
You are the one who scammed him.

973
01:04:31.484 --> 01:04:34.684
If my mom and dad get divorced, is it because of me?

974
01:04:34.684 --> 01:04:37.624
Since when did our Seo Hyun become so mature?

975
01:04:37.624 --> 01:04:41.094
Can you tell me how to make him run away from me?

976
01:04:41.154 --> 01:04:42.594
I am going to do a proper background check.

977
01:04:42.654 --> 01:04:44.064
To see if he is someone I can approve of...

978
01:04:44.124 --> 01:04:45.324
or someone I need to keep away from her.

979
01:04:45.394 --> 01:04:48.394
- I really want to be happy today. - Let us see how we end up...

980
01:04:48.464 --> 01:04:50.004
and take this all the way to the end.
